| RunNatCxx - a C++ program compiled, linked and run on RISC OS 64 with the native C++ compiler.  double-click RunNatCxx
| the C++ compiler needs a big application slot
WimpSlot -min 128M -max 128M
Echo ===== compile
Obey Clean
<T64$Dir>.xg++ -B bin/ -B lib/ -L lib -isystem include/c++/16.2.0 -isystem include/c++/16.2.0/aarch64-riscos -isystem include -O1 -x c++ -c cc/hellopp -o o/hellopp
Echo ===== link
Obey Clean
<T64$Dir>.xg++ -B bin/ -B lib/ -L lib -munixlib o/hellopp -o out/hellopp
SetType <T64$Dir>.out.hellopp &FF8
Echo ===== run
<T64$Dir>.out.hellopp
Echo Finished.
